WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.703
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:04.837
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:04.837 --> 00:00:06.439
And now we're gonna
get to the news.

00:00:06.439 --> 00:00:07.940
The Democratic
National Committee

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:09.709
held its annual holiday party
last night

00:00:09.709 --> 00:00:11.377
outside of
the Hotel Washington due to

00:00:11.377 --> 00:00:13.479
the spread of
the Omicron variant.

00:00:13.479 --> 00:00:15.548
Meanwhile,
the Republican holiday party

00:00:15.548 --> 00:00:18.284
just added more mistletoe.

00:00:19.585 --> 00:00:22.688
President Biden attended
the DNC's annual holiday party

00:00:22.688 --> 00:00:28.161
last night and gave a 10-minute
speech in just under an hour.

00:00:28.995 --> 00:00:31.631
In his speech at
last night's DNC holiday party,

00:00:31.631 --> 00:00:34.800
House Speaker Nancy Pelosi
praised President Biden

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:37.770
and said he was the "perfect
president for the times,"

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:42.908
because the times
are also very unpopular.

00:00:42.908 --> 00:00:46.112
New York mayor-elect Eric Adams
announced yesterday

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:48.348
that he will appoint
Nassau County

00:00:48.348 --> 00:00:50.617
Chief of Detectives
Keechant Sewell

00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:52.985
as the city's first-ever
female police commissioner,

00:00:52.985 --> 00:00:55.087
because isn't it time
a woman had

00:00:55.087 --> 00:00:58.291
the worst job in New York?

00:00:58.291 --> 00:01:00.927
Singer Grimes tweeted yesterday
that her ex-boyfriend,

00:01:00.927 --> 00:01:03.496
Tesla C.E.O. Elon Musk,
cut his own hair

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:04.530
for his "Time" magazine

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:06.299
Person of the Year
magazine cover.

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:08.735
Well, it was either that or
he went to a Supercuts

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:11.137
and handed them
a picture of Beaker.

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:16.976
A New York
ethics board yesterday

00:01:16.976 --> 00:01:19.312
gave disgraced former governor
Andrew Cuomo

00:01:19.312 --> 00:01:22.949
30 days to pay back his
$5.1 million book deal.

00:01:22.949 --> 00:01:24.483
And this might be the first time

00:01:24.483 --> 00:01:28.521
he's reluctant
to kiss something goodbye.

00:01:28.521 --> 00:01:29.555
According to the latest numbers,

00:01:29.555 --> 00:01:32.558
deliveries by
UPS, FedEx, and USPS

00:01:32.558 --> 00:01:35.595
are arriving at a
nearly perfect on-time speed,

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:38.064
so maybe tomorrow,
instead of taking the subway,

00:01:38.064 --> 00:01:41.467
just mail yourself to work.

00:01:41.467 --> 00:01:44.937
In a recent video on TikTok,
a Mississippi woman claimed that

00:01:44.937 --> 00:01:47.874
she accidentally live-streamed
herself having sex

00:01:47.874 --> 00:01:49.542
with her husband on Facebook.

00:01:49.542 --> 00:01:51.043
Oh, weird.

00:01:51.043 --> 00:01:53.646
I didn't even realize you could
still poke people on Facebook.

00:01:53.646 --> 00:01:55.682
[ Laughter ]

00:01:58.384 --> 00:02:00.419
I guess they also know
that punch line's

00:02:00.419 --> 00:02:02.188
five years old.

00:02:03.523 --> 00:02:05.524
And, finally, during
last night's game against

00:02:05.524 --> 00:02:07.627
the New York Knicks,
Golden State Warriors star

00:02:07.627 --> 00:02:10.596
Steph Curry broke the NBA record
for most 3-pointers.

00:02:10.596 --> 00:02:12.732
[ Cheers and applause ]
Yeah.

00:02:14.133 --> 00:02:17.036
And received a standing ovation
at Madison Square Garden,

00:02:17.036 --> 00:02:18.437
which was tough for Knicks fans,

00:02:18.437 --> 00:02:20.807
because they'd totally
forgotten how to do that.

00:02:20.807 --> 00:02:22.742
And that was
a monologue, everybody.

